{"translation":{"id":"ory_irv","name":"ଇଣ୍ଡିୟାନ ରିୱାଇସ୍ଡ୍ ୱରସନ୍ ଓଡିଆ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Oriya Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"ory","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"fe09301e6f43dbbcfcb30753438997976ee983751a3278733f551d91025dee13","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","languageEnglishName":"Odia"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"ory_irv","name":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","commonName":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","title":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"66539124e8124247ab4799343f0663cb93d027589d0e40219697891b1f630152","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":120,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ସାହାଯ୍ୟ ପ୍ରାର୍ଥନା"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ଆରୋହଣ ଗୀତ।"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ମୁଁ ଆପଣା ବିପଦରେ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁଙ୍କ ନିକଟରେ ପ୍ରାର୍ଥନା କଲି,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ତହିଁରେ ସେ ମୋତେ ଉତ୍ତର ଦେଲେ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ହେ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୋ, ମିଥ୍ୟାବାଦୀ ଓଷ୍ଠାଧରରୁ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଓ ପ୍ରବଞ୍ଚକ ଜିହ୍ୱାରୁ ମୋʼ ପ୍ରାଣକୁ ଉଦ୍ଧାର କର।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ହେ ପ୍ରବଞ୍ଚକ ଜିହ୍ୱେ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ତୁମ୍ଭକୁ କଅଣ ଦିଆଯିବ ଓ ତୁମ୍ଭ ପ୍ରତି ଅଧିକ କଅଣ କରାଯିବ?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ବୀରର ତୀକ୍ଷ୍ଣ ତୀର ଓ ରେତମ କାଷ୍ଠର ଅଙ୍ଗାର ସହ ଦଣ୍ଡ ଦେବେ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ହାୟ, ହାୟ, ମୁଁ ମେଶକ୍‍ରେ ପ୍ରବାସ କରେ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ମୁଁ କେଦାରର ତମ୍ବୁସମୂହ ମଧ୍ୟରେ ବାସ କରେ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଶାନ୍ତି ଘୃଣାକାରୀ ଲୋକ ସହିତ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ମୋʼ ପ୍ରାଣ ଦୀର୍ଘ କାଳ ବାସ କରିଅଛି।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ମୁଁ ଶାନ୍ତି ଚାହେଁ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ମାତ୍ର ମୁଁ କଥା କହିଲେ, ସେମାନେ ଯୁଦ୍ଧ ଚାହାନ୍ତି।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/120.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/121.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/119.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}